hadiths[4]{hadithnumber,text}:
"115","[AI-translation] Hamein Mahmood bin Ghailan aur Yousuf bin Eesa ne hadith bayan ki, dono ne farmaya: hamein Waki' ne hadith bayan ki, Musawir al-Warraaq se, unhone Ja'far bin 'Amr bin Huraith se, unhone apne waalid se, ke Nabi sallallahu 'alaihi wa sallam ne logo ko khutbah di, aur aap ke pas kale imamah the."
"116","[AI-translation] Hamein Haroon bin Ishaq al-Hamdani ne hadith bayan ki, farmaye: hamein Yahya bin Muhammad al-Madani ne hadith bayan ki, Abdul Aziz bin Muhammad se, unhone Ubaidullah bin Umar se, unhone Nafi' se, unhone Ibn Umar se, farmaya: Nabi sallallahu 'alaihi wa sallam jab imamah bandhte, to apne dono kandhon ke darmiyan imamah ka shikwa latka dete."
"117","[AI-translation] Hamein Yousuf bin Eesa ne hadith bayan ki, farmaye: hamein Waki' ne hadith bayan ki, farmaye: hamein Abu Sulaiman ne hadith bayan ki, aur woh Abdur Rahman bin Al-Ghaseel hain, unhone Ikrimah se, unhone Ibn Abbas se: ke Nabi sallallahu 'alaihi wa sallam ne logo ko khutbah di, aur aap ke sar par 'isabah dasma (tiil wali patti) tha."
"118","[AI-translation] Hamein Ahmad bin Mani' ne hadith bayan ki, farmaye: hamein Isma'il bin Ibrahim ne hadith bayan ki, farmaye: hamein Ayyub ne hadith bayan ki, Humaid bin Hilal se, unhone Abi Burdah se, unhone farmaya: Aishah ne hamare paas ek mullab kisa aur ek ghaleez izar nikal diya, aur farmaya: Rasoolullah sallallahu 'alaihi wa sallam ki rooh inhi dono mein qabz hui."
